# API Security

- Every business query includes `where: { agencyId: user.agencyId }` (or equivalent).
- Never take `agencyId` from the client without verifying it matches the JWT/session.
- Passwords only with bcrypt (cost ≥ 10). Never log tokens or passwords.
- Enforce RBAC with Nest guards (`ADMIN` / `GERENTE` / `ASESOR`).
- DTO validation is mandatory (Zod or class-validator + ValidationPipe).
- Do not interpolate raw SQL with user input; use Prisma parameterization.
